n.curvature","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The curvature `F_∇ = ∇² : A → Ω²(A)` (represented as endo). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalInstanton.connection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalInstanton.connection","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The connection morphism `∇ : A → A ⊗ Ω¹(A)` (represented as endo). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalInstanton.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalInstanton.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalInstanton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalInstanton","kind":"structure","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.lean#L35-L52","doc":"**Categorical instanton**: a connection whose curvature is self-dual\nwith respect to the q-Hodge star `⋆_q`.\n\n`⋆_q F_∇ = F_∇`, equivalently `F_∇` lies in the `+1`-eigenspace\n`Ω⁺(A)` of the Hodge involution.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:categorical-instanton}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-instanton","label":"def:categorical-instanton","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}